{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Chimi  $Marisa  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Marisa Kirisame",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the unchanging goddess."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The middle of the Forest of Sanctuaries."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It was also known as the forest where the pyramid was."
            ]
        },
        "41_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Chimi  >Oh, to think the pyramid was such an important object."
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Apparently it's a facility of the Lunar Capital."
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Chimi  >That reminds me, I often hear rumors of the Lunarians here in the Sanctuaries."
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Calling this place a sanctuary in the first place was probably to stave off youkai."
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Chimi  >I appreciate you making the effort to tell me."
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >I thought you might know something, since you said you were old."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Chimi  >You have a point, us houjuu were born even before youkai existed."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "We're basically youkai before they were named."
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Chimi  >Here in the Sanctuaries, we were able to remain unchanged."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It allowed us to be cut off from the outside world."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "From what you're saying, I can see now that the nature of the sanctuary comes from the pyramid."
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Huh, that explains it."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Chimi  >And if that's the case, then the altar remains important to us."
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The same goes for the yamanbas."
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whether it's a facility of the Lunar Capital or not."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >By the way, do you know about the dosoujin placed on the altar?"
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Chimi  >Hm? The dosoujin on the altar?",
                "<l$> Oh, I was the one who placed her there, how nostalgic."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >She has a will over her own now.",
                "<l$> She looked a bit lonely."
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Chimi  >A will of her own? Really now?"
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Chimi  >Sorry, but could you play with them once in a while?"
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It'd be a pity to isolate a newborn god, unlike us she's not here by choice."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Marisa  >Sure thing. But man, her riddles were downright unreasonable."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Sanctuaries, which had been the center of the incident, remained completely unchanged."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No, its lack of change was exactly what defined this incident, the Sanctuaries was a location where changes were few to begin with."
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's safe to say that none of the dwellers of the Sanctuaries were involved with the incident."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The barrier placed around the Sanctuaries was likely Ariya's."
            ]
        },
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$ Ending No. 12 Dwellers of the Sanctuaries $>"
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Because using Incident Stone made it possible to enter."
            ]
        }
    }
}